# WWJDchat Environment Configuration

# ==============================================================================
# LOCAL DEVELOPMENT SETUP
# ==============================================================================
# To configure the OpenAI API key locally:
# 1. Copy this file and rename it to ".env.local" (which is ignored by Git).
# 2. Replace the dummy value below with your actual OpenAI API Key.
#
# When running locally, the Vercel serverless function (via Vercel CLI) or 
# our dev environment will load this key. If not configured, the frontend will
# automatically fall back to simulated mock reflections.

OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here

# ==============================================================================
# VERCEL DEPLOYMENT SETUP
# ==============================================================================
# To load this key into your production environment on Vercel:
# 1. Go to your Vercel Dashboard (https://vercel.com) and select your project.
# 2. Navigate to "Settings" > "Environment Variables".
# 3. Add a new variable:
#    - Key: OPENAI_API_KEY
#    - Value: [Your actual OpenAI API Key, e.g., sk-proj-...]
# 4. Click "Add" and redeploy your project.
#
# Vercel will automatically inject this key into the serverless function environment.
